# New Fadama SDA Children's Ministries

Django monolith for New Fadama Seventh-day Adventist Church Children's Ministries. It records children, guardians, classes, and Sabbath attendance. A child's school is a text field. Classes are a fixed ladder from Pre-school through SHS 3.

- Templates and HTMX only. No React, Vue, or a separate frontend app.
- PostgreSQL only. No Redis, Celery, Kafka, or Elasticsearch.
- Docker Compose is the development and deployment environment: one Django container and one PostgreSQL container. Do not add Nginx or other services unless a requirement explicitly asks for them.
- WhiteNoise serves static files from the Django container.
- Time zone is Africa/Accra. Sabbath is Saturday. Attendance statuses are PRESENT and ABSENT only.
- The current Sabbath is the latest Saturday on or before today and stays open through Friday. Past Sabbath edit is coordinator/admin only.
- Visitors are separate from children; visits count toward Present totals but not the class roll.
- An unrecorded Sabbath is not an absence.
- Age is calculated from date of birth and is never stored.
- Do not cascade-delete attendance. Deactivate children instead.
- Permissions are Django groups: ADMIN, COORDINATOR, TEACHER. Enforce them on the server.
- Keep documentation in docs/ aligned with the code.
